sequenceDiagram
    participant P1 as Client
    participant P2 as External API Proxy
    participant P3 as Identity Resolver
    P1->>P2: Request with Authorization
    alt Ro-Passthrough in enabled non-production environment
        P2->>P3: Extract client ID and patient UUID
        P3-->>P2: Unverified identity
    else Bearer token
        P2->>P3: Verify JWT
        P3-->>P2: Verified claims
    end
